    "x": 1238.9685039370079,
    "y": 2329,
    "width": 189.03955078125,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "8.580319",
    "x": 1593.9685039370079,
    "y": 2329,
    "width": 112.6142578125,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "9.556834",
    "x": 1841.9685039370079,
    "y": 2329,
    "width": 112.6142578125,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "0.156868",
    "x": 2089.968503937008,
    "y": 2329,
    "width": 112.6142578125,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "Dynamic (G)",
    "x": 1238.9685039370079,
    "y": 2396,
    "width": 159.03369140625,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "8.176990",
    "x": 1593.9685039370079,
    "y": 2396,
    "width": 112.6142578125,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "9.326647",
    "x": 1841.9685039370079,
    "y": 2396,
    "width": 112.6142578125,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "0.157163",
    "x": 2089.968503937008,
    "y": 2396,
    "width": 112.6142578125,
    "size": 27
  },
  {
    "text": "Total loss includes security loss plus business and action costs. Final state is the",
    "x": 1230.9685039370079,
    "y": 2491,
    "width": 927.7734375000001,
    "size": 26
  },
  {
    "text": "value-weighted compromised fraction at T = 10.",
    "x": 1230.9685039370079,
    "y": 2527,
    "width": 548.4375,
    "size": 26
  },
  {
    "text": "05",
    "x": 1230.9685039370079,
    "y": 2649,
    "width": 34.4814453125,
    "size": 31
  },
  {
    "text": "Timing shapes the loss–state tradeoff",
    "x": 1295.9685039370079,
    "y": 2647,
    "width": 735.89794921875,
    "size": 41
  },
  {
    "text": "The dynamic plan reduces accumulated compromise and total defender loss.",
    "x": 1230.9685039370079,
    "y": 2737,
    "width": 1022.2119140625,
    "size": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "The fixed-mean plan has a slightly lower final weighted compromised fraction",
    "x": 1230.9685039370079,
    "y": 2780,
    "width": 1022.16796875,
    "size": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "(0.156868 versus 0.157163).",
    "x": 1230.9685039370079,
    "y": 2823,
    "width": 383.5986328125,
    "size": 30
  },
  {
    "text": "The computed controls are capacity-feasible at B = 0.6, 1.2 and 1.8. Uniform-start",
    "x": 1230.9685039370079,
    "y": 2935,
    "width": 1046.9453125,
    "size": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "paths meet the numerical stopping criteria after five alternating updates.",
    "x": 1230.9685039370079,
    "y": 2976,
    "width": 920.45263671875,
    "size": 29
  },
  {
    "text": "MODEL & EVIDENCE",
    "x": 85,
    "y": 3137,
    "width": 240.0234375,
    "size": 24
  },
  {
    "text": "Synthetic six-asset network. Complete-information, nonzero-sum open-loop game. Local numerical responses in a piecewise-constant strategy class.",
    "x": 85,
    "y": 3180,
    "width": 1779.837890625,
    "size": 27
  },
